{"data": {"event": {"id": "8bd3ef4c-04b0-41e9-9882-c6444bd87f42", "picture": "https://services.medicalcongress.online/congress/medias/2026/JFR2026/864/video/thumbs/poster.jpg", "sessionType": "S\u00e9ances de cours", "sessionTypeColor": "#6545fa", "voting": null, "title": "IA g\u00e9n\u00e9rative en radiologie : du diagnostic \u00e0 l\u2019interventionnel en passant par la recherche", "start": "2026-10-08T11:15+02:00", "end": "2026-10-08T12:15+02:00", "objectives": ["<p>Cette s\u00e9ance propose une mise au point pratique sur l\u2019apport de l\u2019IA g\u00e9n\u00e9rative en radiologie, en couvrant trois champs compl\u00e9mentaires : l\u2019imagerie diagnostique, la radiologie interventionnelle et la recherche. Le premier cours met en avant comme ce compagnon num\u00e9rique peut faciliter&nbsp;notamment la structuration et la pr\u00e9-r\u00e9daction du compte rendu, la synth\u00e8se de dossiers et l\u2019am\u00e9lioration de la communication, tout en insistant sur le risque d\u2019hallucination et la n\u00e9cessit\u00e9 d\u2019un contr\u00f4le syst\u00e9matique par le radiologue. Le deuxi\u00e8me cours aborde les applications en radiologie interventionnelle : standardisation des protocoles, checklists de s\u00e9curit\u00e9, pr\u00e9paration du patient, documentation proc\u00e9durale et tra\u00e7abilit\u00e9, avec un focus sur les garde-fous indispensables pour \u00e9viter des recommandations inadapt\u00e9es. Le troisi\u00e8me cours explore les usages en recherche (protocoles, dictionnaires de donn\u00e9es, plan d\u2019analyse, assistance r\u00e9dactionnelle), en rappelant les enjeux d\u2019int\u00e9grit\u00e9 scientifique, de v\u00e9rification des sources et de protection des donn\u00e9es. La s\u00e9ance fournit un cadre d\u2019int\u00e9gration r\u00e9aliste : p\u00e9rim\u00e8tre d\u2019usage d\u00e9fini, prompts cadr\u00e9s, gouvernance, auditabilit\u00e9 et responsabilit\u00e9 m\u00e9dicale maintenue.</p>"], "onAir": null, "vod": {"checkPermissions": ["media:view"], "media": null}, "broadcasts": {"items": []}, "room": {"id": "03a167ae-25bc-4a8d-b359-72fc2fd54ad1", "name": "351", "type": "ROOM"}, "schedule": {"items": [{"id": "c1cca19a-95a5-44fa-a43a-4def3cac3f34", "title": "IA g\u00e9n\u00e9rative en imagerie diagnostique", "start": "2026-10-08T11:15+02:00", "end": "2026-10-08T11:30+02:00", "element": {"abstract": {"id": "C1CCA19A-95A5-44FA-A43A-4DEF3CAC3F34"}}, "speakers": {"items": [{"id": "e1d01309-fcbc-43c1-8419-90e75a1800eb", "lastName": "Jenoudet", "firstName": "Hala", "roles": [{"name": "speaker"}], "photo": {"url": "https://services.y-congress.com/congress/wspreview/getphoto.aspx?idPhoto=236604&t=1"}, "country": {"name": "France"}, "city": {"name": "Nice"}}]}, "vod": {"checkPermissions": ["media:view"], "media": {"id": "7a19f560-59fc-4e95-ac12-5b25529f87a6", "type": "VIDEO", "thumbnail": "https://services.medicalcongress.online/congress/medias/2026/JFR2026/864/video/thumbs/poster.jpg", "element": {"sources": [{"uri": "https://services.medicalcongress.online/congress/medias/2026/JFR2026/864/video/y_1080p_4000kb.mp4?verify=1791498968-en%2FNCS4Zi4wrQIZkYvhWBGWQ4HqjC0%2B5lhA590AXNdA%3D"}, {"uri": "https://services.medicalcongress.online/congress/medias/2026/JFR2026/864/video/y_480p_800kb.mp4?verify=1791498968-7lbhtJ4Zcr81XEsAl%2BBqCORlHnG96ffNxicrxSgqv30%3D"}]}}}}, {"id": "af3266c5-6b50-421c-862f-5e18a1ea1fe5", "title": "IA g\u00e9n\u00e9rative en recherche en radiologie", "start": "2026-10-08T11:30+02:00", "end": "2026-10-08T11:45+02:00", "element": {"abstract": {"id": "AF3266C5-6B50-421C-862F-5E18A1EA1FE5"}}, "speakers": {"items": []}, "vod": {"checkPermissions": ["media:view"], "media": {"id": "f9ec90c7-0a89-4442-8120-5d1439756e6e", "type": "VIDEO", "thumbnail": "https://services.medicalcongress.online/congress/medias/2026/JFR2026/865/video/thumbs/poster.jpg", "element": {"sources": [{"uri": "https://services.medicalcongress.online/congress/medias/2026/JFR2026/865/video/y_1080p_4000kb.mp4?verify=1791498968-Em9oTB96Nl